---
title: "Fundamentals of Computer Technology"
code: "ETR-166"
category: "electronics-technology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces computer use and literacy. Includes operating systems, high level language programming, word processors, spreadsheets and other generic software. Uses engineering terms, standards and methods. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 1 hour. Total 3 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
